   "reference": "keep a dictionary of pattern to handler and, per query, test every pattern of the right length and keep the best (wildcard count, wildcard positions) key",
   "candidate_design": "segment trie whose children are literal segments plus one \"*\" child; a query walks the trie depth first, literal child before \"*\", carrying the wildcard count, pruning branches whose count already exceeds the best complete match, and keeps the first best match found in that order",
